e themselves to  go to amazon to find the tears of the  moon the scene moves to south america  where a skipper called frank is taking a  group of rich people on a ride across  the amazon river on his old boat laquila  he has set up a bunch of cheap tricks to  entertain the passengers but they don't  seem interested in that as they are  frightened every time he performs the  tricks  he also engages in many lame puns which  confuse the passengers because of that  even one of the passengers is willing to  pay him a lot of money only to make the  boat go faster  long story short lily and mcgregor  arrive in south america to seek out nilo  a harbour master that will provide them  a boat for the expedition  turns out that franco's nilo money and  he decides to take out frank boat's  engine until he pays the debt frank  secretly follows him and sneaks into his  office to get his engine back  in the meantime  while mcgregor goes around the bar lily  arrives at neila's office and meets  frank who disguises himself as nilo she  helps him to retrieve his boat key and  frank somehow manages to convince her to  hire him for the expedition to the tree  they almost come to an agreement until  mcgregor appears with a real nilo lily  has lost her trust in the skipper and  when she is about to leave suddenly a  wild jaguar appears and starts  terrorizing people in the bar  frank decides to fight the jaguar and  manages to take him out of the bar with  a piece of meat  this action then convinces lily and  mcgregor to hire him for the expedition  as frank reclaims his engine he reveals  that the jaguar proxima is frank's pet  and he deliberately ordered proxima to  make a scene at the bar while frank and  mcgregor are debating about the luggages  lily is kidnapped by bird poachers hired  by joachim luckily she is a professional  lock picker and manages to free herself  from the cage  frank comes to help her and they run  towards the boat as joachim's henchmen  chase after them  long story short after a long and  exhausting chase lily frank and mcgregor  regroup on la cuela and the journey to  the tree begins  realizing that lily escaped from his  men's grasp the german emerges from his  submarine and starts firing at them with  a machine gun causing the boat to lose  power and force frank to move the boat  manually he even launches a torpedo at  them but frank manages to drive the boat  through an old building as the torpedo  passes under them they eventually run  away from joachim while the submarine  gets stuck and hits nila's other boats  on their way frank tries to get closer  to the siblings by telling his cheap  jokes  lily also introduces a moving picture  camera to the skipper they decide to  stop to rest while frank serves them  freshly fried piranhas for dinner later  that night lily and mcgregor figure out  that proxima is frank's pet this fact  makes lily very upset and loses her  trust again on the other side joachim  and his men head over to an underground  cavern where agira and his men were  imprisoned joachim drips river water  which awakens agira who currently  possesses snakes within his body he  agrees to help the german to seek out  the tears of the moon because it's the  only way to break the curse  with a detonator joachim floods the  cavern with river water to reawaken the  remaining conquistadors  the next day thanks to the route lily  chose earlier they come across rough  water and nearly fall down to a huge  waterfall  luckily frank is a skillful boat driver  and manages to get them on the other  path to safety they pull over to the  land and stop for a moment while cutting  down trees mcgregor implicitly reveals  to frank that he was disowned by his  family because he is gay he adds that  lily was always there for him supporting  him that's why he is willing to follow  her wherever she goes  lily sneaks into frank's room where she  discovers that he is a big fan of  automobiles and finds several maps of  the magic tree upon the men returning to  the boat lily immediately accuses frank  telling him that he's after the tears of  the moon for himself  he then tells her that he has given up  on that plan for a very long time  because he always failed a few moments  later they are knocked out by darts  they are captured by locals and are  brought to a native tribe the chieftain  who speaks in tupi language requests  lily to give them back the arrowhead  lily insists and refuses to give it up  she then manages to break free in  attempts to escape  however sam reveals that the scene has  been set up by frank  lily is infuriated with his constant  deception and punches him  later lily talks to sam who helps her to  translate the writing in the arrowhead  she informs her the exact location of  the tree and explains that the tree only  blooms under a blood moon which occurs  in two days  suddenly agira and his men with their  disgusting appearance appear at the  tribe and start attacking people it  seems like agira and frank know each  other the skipper and lily attempt to  escape through a rope but they fail  after a rough fight the conquistadors  managed to get the arrowhead but frank  retrieves it and throws it back to lily  while he gets stabbed by aguirre's blade  and falls down to the water  lily escapes and is told to get away  from the river the conquistadors have to  pull back since the curse prevents them  from going beyond the river they then  send a message to joachim by using the  bees the next day lily is shocked when  he finds out that frank is alive with  the blade still stabbed in his chest he  then reveals that his real name is  francisco and he is roughly 400 years  old  lily helps him to pull the blade out of  his chest  frank and lily continue their journey  themselves while mcgregor stays behind  with sam since he is injured  frank shares his past story to the woman  he and nagira had grown up together like  brothers at some point aguirre's  daughter had fallen ill an